{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e432cfced8fb6345b854c6f51a5cd909caf9ae2cde0332b9a228811932deda50", "ja": "（アイドル達の写真を使ったタロットカードの撮影。\n今日はひなたの番だ。ひなたの様子は……）", "zh": "（拍摄使用偶像们照片的塔罗牌。今天轮到日向了。日向的状态怎么样呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "7cb3664997b68783ef26c2de5903e465165c146af2533998882f483af0e9f909", "ja": "天秤で善悪の重さをはかって、公正にさばく……。\n悪人には、剣で罰を……はや～。", "zh": "用天秤衡量善恶的轻重，公正地裁决……\n对坏人，用剑降下惩罚……哇～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1002_p", "source_sha256": "27bc07d24567680cc3435dd3638cc2238e0c0925782d64481d25cff8efef6dd9", "ja": "おっ、ひなた。\nもしかして、今日のカードの予習中か？", "zh": "哦，小日向。\n难道你正在预习今天的卡片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "8c7c3b0e58ea3d644b492365055ebb5274be8c2fd1328c9ef6eb61ca3882f650", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、お疲れさんです。\nそうだよぉ、しっかり勉強せねば。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，辛苦啦。\n是呀，得好好学习才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "f924906841fa28d12dc0341cdbaa348ff1d605a33570cc74fb8f3303a0139050", "ja": "あたしは、人の善悪を測る女神様なんだって。\nなんだか、閻魔様みたいだべさ。", "zh": "听说我是衡量人类善恶的女神大人。\n总觉得，和阎王大人挺像的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1005_p", "source_sha256": "43e99011b529be3bfc51e8e2dd2fcd9ca89694e8c33fbd45c437b4ffbd4997bb", "ja": "閻魔様か。確かに、そう言われるとそうだな。", "zh": "阎王吗？确实，你这么一说还真是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "0a6d826e04c7816ea572b26114c2bda6cf8e5736442818177a7e889c29e45071", "ja": "おっかない神様だねえ。あたしも怒られんように、\n気をつけないとだよぉ。", "zh": "真是个可怕的神明啊。为了不被训斥，我也得小心一点才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4825e88264fa6307228b15a505888b60bac98f5db9cb6637e784578b82a9b89d", "ja": "ひなたは大丈夫なんじゃないか？\nあんまり悪いことはしなさそうだし。", "zh": "日向应该没问题吧？\n感觉她也不太会做什么坏事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "719f9d02a2a837755088c0f9f030f6b48bea3684d408e1bc37033b2c277b3044", "ja": "そんなことないべさ。あたしにだって、\n頭の中にちっこい悪魔が出てくることもあるんだよぉ。", "zh": "才不是那样呢。我脑子里偶尔也会冒出一个小恶魔的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4e30e4b4d531237ad4fd9db370fb90d529b91ce5ad022122874a5094a2ad4b80", "ja": "え、そうなのか？　ちょっと想像できないな……。\n今日のレッスンをサボりたい、とか？", "zh": "咦，原来是这样吗？我有点想象不出来……比如说，想翘掉今天的课程之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "8199e5e904238d571fd126b19a162e865b0b88e202663410867b9ec3ec534d82", "ja": "そういうのは思わないべさ。しっかりレッスンして、\nもっと上手になりたいもの。", "zh": "我可没这么想过呀。要好好练习，变得更厉害才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "66d246057c1d45f7b628b1f51ee91354618a3926e661d06119c4d493e188a248", "ja": "ちっこい悪魔が出てくるのは、夜が多いよぉ。\nあと、昼ご飯と晩ご飯の間とかかねぇ……ふふ。", "zh": "小恶魔出现的时候，大多是在晚上哦。还有午饭和晚饭之间吧……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4fbddf3f39a653aff37a14b4afec60cd2e08a03a7181934d1e2f6d7de085287b", "ja": "あっ、そうか。間食を我慢しているんだな？", "zh": "啊，原来如此。你是在忍住不吃零食吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "8b2f81a2885e91357b4bf5dc14e1d0b20e678fec6b6dcc43ab18557060331ba7", "ja": "えへへ。\n{$P$}、大正解だべさ～。", "zh": "嘿嘿。\n{$P$}，完全正确～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "4fbfd4cfe2652621f09e325265e75e59e613d0a75b84d15c4c90e15dcc64c7ab", "ja": "勉強やレッスンをがんばったあとは、お腹が\n空いてしまってねぇ。でも、食べるとまずいしょや？", "zh": "努力学习和练习之后，肚子就会饿起来呢。不过，吃东西又不太好，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1015_p", "source_sha256": "95735d5c1c2a62f324a5095e2aef0c78b54dc53bf590e488d30c28196941bd91", "ja": "なるほどな。\nでも、我慢しすぎるのもよくないと思うけど。", "zh": "原来如此。不过，我觉得忍得太过头也不太好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "a7076094913ab50a7eb09ef2e21773da9c28f21df323732e049fa42b881dae6d", "ja": "だめだめ！　都会には美味しいものがいっぱいで。\n食べたいけど……、止まらなくなっちゃうべさ……。", "zh": "不行不行！城里好吃的东西太多了。  \n虽然想吃……可是会停不下来的嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1017_p", "source_sha256": "634e3860997a07ec4166d942f2ab6e2f48bb48fbc0a0e3532705166e3e257455", "ja": "そんな深刻そうに……。少しなら\nいいんじゃないか？　食べ過ぎなきゃいいんだし。", "zh": "别这么严肃嘛……。吃一点应该没关系吧？只要别吃多了就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "01ec8ed9687ae24ca37cd2f93430a1560d79865e75a057bdd88b0da975ff9fbb", "ja": "う、うん……それじゃあ{$P$}、\n撮影終わったら、一緒にお菓子休憩しないかい？", "zh": "嗯、嗯……那{$P$}，\n等拍摄结束之后，要不要一起吃点心休息一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0213_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "e34499b52b793cf509055cd317d91974967b1e8b577591486394c0f4449649e9", "ja": "話していたら、なんだかちょっこし\n食べたくなってきちゃったべさ……。えへへ♪", "zh": "聊着聊着，不知怎么的，突然有点想吃东西了……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
